# 18. Complete Cloud Architecture Example

A simple cloud architecture might look like:

```text
                         INTERNET
                             |
                             v
                    Internet Gateway
                             |
                             v
                  +-------------------+
                  |       VPC         |
                  |   10.0.0.0/16     |
                  |                   |
                  |  +-------------+  |
                  |  |   Public    |  |
                  |  |   Subnet    |  |
                  |  | 10.0.1.0/24 |  |
                  |  |             |  |
                  |  | Load Balancer|  |
                  |  +------+------++  |
                  |         |          |
                  |         v          |
                  |  +-------------+  |
                  |  |   Private   |  |
                  |  |   Subnet    |  |
                  |  | 10.0.2.0/24 |  |
                  |  |             |  |
                  |  | App Servers |  |
                  |  | Database    |  |
                  |  +-------------+  |
                  +-------------------+
```

The basic idea is:

```text
CIDR
  ↓
VPC
  ↓
Subnets
  ↓
IP Addresses
  ↓
Routing
  ↓
Security
```

